  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your strikes are charged with the destructive power of the stars themselves.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Base attack bonus +1, ability to manifest a constellation’s weapon form.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you are wielding the weapon form of a constellation, you may spend a swift action to release some of the constellation’s latent power, dealing an additional 2 points of energy damage of the constellation’s element type with all attacks made with it for 1 round. You may invest essence into this feat, increasing the additional energy damage by 2 per point of essence invested.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc50\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
